<Layout title="Kin & Campus | Personalized care for college students">
<div class="w hero2"><div><div class="eyebrow">Personalized care for college students</div><h1>We're there for your student while they're away.</h1><p class="lead">A home away from home for your child's health. A pediatrician who knows their history, answers when they need help, and keeps you in the loop, with your student's permission.</p><p><a class="btn" href="/join">Reserve a spot</a> &nbsp; <a class="lnk" href="/care">See how we care &rarr;</a></p></div>
<svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 520 420" role="img" aria-label="A warm lit house nestled below blue ridge hills"><rect width="520" height="420" rx="28" fill="#F6EFE4"/><circle cx="372" cy="92" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="10"/><circle cx="418" cy="92" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="10"/><path d="M0 300L90 220 170 280 260 190 360 270 440 210 520 280V420H0z" fill="#C5D2C1"/><path d="M0 340L120 270 220 330 330 260 430 320 520 285V420H0z" fill="#9CAF98"/><path d="M0 372Q260 330 520 372V420H0z" fill="#7E9A7C"/><path d="M245 360h30l28 60H217z" fill="#EADFCB"/><rect x="190" y="272" width="140" height="88" fill="#FBF7F0" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M174 276L260 204 346 276z" fill="#6B2737"/><rect x="300" y="214" width="16" height="36" fill="#6B2737"/><rect x="244" y="304" width="32" height="56" rx="4" fill="#C9A24B"/><rect x="204" y="294" width="28" height="28" fill="#F6D58A" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="288" y="294" width="28" height="28" fill="#F6D58A" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M80 372l22-50 22 50zM116 372l18-40 18 40zM400 372l22-50 22 50z" fill="#4F6B53"/></svg></div>
<div class="w"><div class="trust"><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg><b>A pediatrician who knows them</b><span>Not a different provider every visit.</span></div><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chat"/></svg><b>Reach us when you can't reach them</b><span>Direct access, [RESPONSE TIME].</span></div><div><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg><b>Never left wondering</b><span>Updates, shared with your student's consent.</span></div></div></div>
<section><div class="w split"><div><div class="eyebrow">For the parent who can't be there</div><h2>You packed the car, hugged them goodbye, and drove home with a hundred what-ifs.</h2><p>What if they get sick and don't go in? What if their asthma flares during finals? What if they're struggling and don't tell you? Kin &amp; Campus is the answer to those what-ifs: a doctor in your student's corner, a few minutes from campus, who you can trust.</p></div>
<svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 600 190" role="img" aria-label="You, Kin and Campus, and your student, connected"><path d="M112 80Q190 10 265 66M335 66Q410 10 488 80" fill="none" stroke="#C9A24B" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="2 10" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="70" cy="82" r="42" fill="#6B2737"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="12" fill="#F6EFE4"/><path d="M46 104q24-26 48 0z" fill="#F6EFE4"/><circle cx="530" cy="82" r="42" fill="#C9A24B"/><circle cx="530" cy="70" r="12" fill="#2A1A1E"/><path d="M506 104q24-26 48 0z" fill="#2A1A1E"/><circle cx="300" cy="78" r="40" fill="#9CAF98"/><path d="M272 84L300 58 328 84v22H272z" fill="#FBF7F0" stroke="#6B2737" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="293" y="90" width="14" height="16" fill="#C9A24B"/><g font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="currentColor" text-anchor="middle"><text x="70" y="150">You</text><text x="300" y="150">Kin &amp; Campus</text><text x="530" y="150">Your student</text></g></svg></div></section>
<section style="padding-top:0"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>Simple for parents. Easy for students.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Join together</h3><p>You enroll. Your student shares their health history, so we know them before the first visit.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">2</div><h3>Meet in Blacksburg</h3><p>An unhurried first visit with a pediatrician, close to campus.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">3</div><h3>Stay connected</h3><p>Direct access when something comes up, and check-ins when the semester gets hard.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="w"><div class="eyebrow">Our privacy promise</div><h2>You'll hear from us. They decide what we share.</h2><p>Your student is an adult, and their health information is theirs. Students who trust their doctor are the ones who actually use them. <a class="lnk2" href="/privacy">How sharing works &rarr;</a></p></div></section>
<section><div class="w" style="text-align:center"><h2>A place for your student to land.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin:16px auto 28px">Spots are limited so every student gets real attention.</p><a class="btn" href="/join">Reserve a spot</a></div></section>
</Layout>
